    "module_designation": "Ultrasonic water meters with electronic indication device",
    "description": "Residential compact ultrasonic water meters with electronic indication device (types U-WR2-15, U-WR2-20 and U-WR2-25) for measuring, memorizing and displaying the volume of clean water in residential use. Measurement is based on the ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle (difference in time-of-flight of ultrasonic pulses with and against the flow). Meters with R500 can be installed in all positions; R800 in H position. Not designed to measure reverse flow. Essential parts: flow sensor (plastic cylindrical body with two reflection sheeds and two ultrasonic transducers) and calculator with indication device (PCB, 9-digit electronic scrolling LCD with indication range 999999.999 m³, one non-replaceable lithium battery for metering). Non-essential parts: filter, local optical port for communication types LoRaWAN Class A, NB-IoT Standard, two-wire pulse output, three-wire pulse output, WM-Bus, M-Bus (optionally), antenna (optionally), one battery for communication, pressure sensor selectable."
